### base32 padding guards

#### keeps valid padded standard base32 decode

- Verify: keeps valid padded standard base32 decode


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 3 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
step("Verify: keeps valid padded standard base32 decode")
assert_equal(bytes_to_text(base32_decode("MY======")), "f")
```

</details>

